	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Multo sępius ad te scriberem, charissime <persName ref="p495">Heinrice</persName>, dum tam frequentes haberem nuncios, quam eos habet <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me inscio <persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Confluunt ad illius domum <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName><pb type="edition" next="149"/> quottidie, quos cum iam abierint, primum rescio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Velim <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>itaque, cum rariores sint meę litterę, quam velim ipse, non mali consulas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tractata in comitiis hodie primum a senatu <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et civibus absolvuntur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Unde de iis certi nihil habeo, quod scribere possim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ceterum librum tuum<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Gemeint sind <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kommentarnotizen oder Scholien zu den Evangelien, <hi>s.</hi> oben S. 140, Anm. 2.</note>, vere thesaurum et celestis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sapientię scrinium, tanto accepi gaudio, ut si tot auri aut argenti misisses, data optione, quantumvis omnes cupiditas divexet, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>hoc unice praeoptassem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Absolvi iam ad verbum manu mea singula, quae in Ioannem notasti, certe non minus certa et genuinum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sensum doctissime explicantia quam clara.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Video ego, quoties tua lego, quam pessime meam collocaverim non modo iuventutem, sed et <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>canos meos.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tametsi post religionis reformationem apud nos susceptam tanta me externa obruerint negocia, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ut vix aliquando contionibus satisfacere potuerim, hoc plane domino tribuerim, quod ab eo tempore, quo cępisti scribere ad me <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et in omnibus tuam operam tuaque consilia adhibere, multo plus in multis me profecisse sentiam quam antea aliquot annis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Delectus est studiorum, auctorum, nimirum et praeceptorum.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Novi <persName ref="p7228">Zuinglium</persName> virum fuisse doctissimum.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Scripsit ad me sępius.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Scripsit et ipse commentationes suas, quae meum certe sic superant ingenium, ut quam paucissima maxime ex iis, quae in Esaiam et <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Hieremiam notavit<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">ZXIV 1-681.</note>, apprehendere potuerim.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Facit hoc linguarum ignorantia.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Caeterum te tanti praeceptoris discipulum sic amplector, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ut nihil non intelligam.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Quare te nec laboris nec fidelitatis tuę, qua charissima quaeque mihi communicas, numquam pęniteat.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Cum mercedem a domino sperare debeat, qui poculum aquae pupillo discipuli nomine porrexerit<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 10, 42</ref></cit>.</note>, quantum tibi mercedis congeres, qui omnia simul dona <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tua, omnes labores, noctes insomnes et vigilias in me unicum effundas.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Hodie Mathęi scolia<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Siehe oben Anm. 1.</note> videre incipio, deinde <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et alia, sic tamen, ut terminum, quem posuisti, non transgrediar.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quodsi certus non adfuerit nuncius, per proprium ad te mittam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Displicuit et perterruit multos, immo deiecit, quod vestrates <placeName ref="l62">Bremgartensibus</placeName> non nisi amice astare voluerint pecuniasque adhuc solvendas <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Antroniis<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Ein von <persName ref="p1391">Haller</persName> öfters verwendeter Spottname für die <placeName ref="l2448">V Orte</placeName>, <hi>s.</hi> <bibl source="b4">HBBW II</bibl> <ref target="file10110">[Nr. 81]</ref> 88, Anm. 3.</note> obtulerint<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><placeName ref="l62">Bremgarten</placeName> (Kt. Aargau), <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Vaterstadt, stand seit dem Zweiten Kappelerkrieg unter ständigem Druck der <placeName ref="l2448">V Orte</placeName>, die die völlige Rekatholisierung der Stadt auch bald erreicht haben (vgl. <bibl source="b137">Bucher</bibl> 175f). <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> hat sich, im Gegensatz zu <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> (vgl. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1c 111), um diese Zeit offenbar nicht um die Notlage der Reformierten in <placeName ref="l62">Bremgarten</placeName> gekümmert, sondern sich den <placeName ref="l2448">V Orten</placeName> gegenüber betont freundschaftlich verhalten (vgl. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1c 93 k.) und von den verlangten 1500 Kronen Kriegsentschädigung 1000 am 25. Juni 1533 bezahlt, s. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1c 101 v.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">De his pauca scribam.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Plura vero colloquar, dum tua gaudere liceat praesentia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8412">Megander</persName>, ut ab <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>aliis odoro, annotationes parat in Ephesios<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p8412">Meganders</persName> Kommentar zum Epheserbrief erschien 1534 in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, s. oben <ref target="file10230">[Nr. 199]</ref> S. 86,72f und Anm. 26.</note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Multa de vobis bona retulit<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Zu <persName ref="p8412">Meganders</persName> Reise nach <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> s. oben <ref target="file10264">[Nr. 233]</ref> S. 140, 5.</note>, sed tam parcus est in loquendo de <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ut semper plura desiderem.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Gaudent fratres nostri omnes de iis, quae cum <persName ref="p8049">Vadiano</persName> in Acta paras<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Kommentar zur Apostelgeschichte erschien im August 1533 (<bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 43; s. noch unten S. 173). - <persName ref="p8049">Vadians</persName> Auslegung der Apostelgeschichte von 1523 blieb ungedruckt, diente jedoch als Grundlage zu seinem theologisch-geographisch-geschichtlichen Handbuch «Epitome trium terrae partium», s. oben <ref target="file10260">[Nr. 229]</ref> S. 134, Anm. 18.</note>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Diu<pb type="edition" next="150"/> enim desiderarunt multi, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quia praeter <persName ref="p5378">Iustum Ionam</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p5378">Justus Jonas</persName>, Annotationes in Acta apostolorum, <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> 1525.</note> nemo in ea quippiam notaverit.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Scribe igitur, quando e prelo expectare liceat, immo si quae excusa sint, mit<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>te.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum uxore<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="11"><persName ref="p8051">Anna Bullinger, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> et liberis, charissima anima mea.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">13. iulii anno 33.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Tuus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p1391">Berch. Hallerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An Meister <persName ref="p495">Heinrich <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>, prędi<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>canten ze <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>sinem günstigen herren <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>und bruͦder.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
